        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/71c47a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-01T05:57:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>After having listened to both of The Letters Page episodes about the Freedom Five tv show, I made an account to ask this question. What would we need to do as a community to have Netflix, or another streaming service, take notice/interest in making an actual cartoon series starring our favorite superheroes? Who do we need to tweet at to make this happen? How would we pitch this (assuming GtG would be down)?</p>",
