        "created_at": "2018-09-01T19:58:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I wouldn’t think fans would have any chance of making this happen by going straight to producers. Find an animation studio that wants to make it happen first. And I don’t think mere tweets will accomplish much.</p>",
