        "username": "MarioFanaticXV",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mariofanaticxv/{size}/2129_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-02T12:43:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Honestly, I don't think it's realistically feasible at this point. There aren't that many great super hero themed tabletop games- and there were even less when Sentinels first released. However, there's a plethora of different super hero themed cartoons out there, the market for that is already overssaturated. This makes it far harder to pitch.</p>",
