        "raw": "<p>Honestly, I don&#39;t think it&#39;s realistically feasible at this point. There aren&#39;t that many great super hero themed tabletop games- and there were even less when Sentinels first released. However, there&#39;s a plethora of different super hero themed cartoons out there, the market for that is already overssaturated. This makes it far harder to pitch.</p>",
