      {
        "id": 221829,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-02T13:06:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MarioFanaticXV\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mariofanaticxv/48/2129_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MarioFanaticXV:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>However, there's a plethora of different super hero themed cartoons out there, the market for that is already overssaturated. This makes it far harder to pitch.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This is a good point. The IPs saturating said market are also what Sentinels is made in homage to; there's going to be a lot of obvious overlap, especially right at the beginning.</p>\n<p>Honestly, for all that this community is large and vibrant, Sentinels is a very niche property. I think people would enjoy it, given a chance to experience its full depth, but convincing anyone whose business is money that it's worth doing is a tall order, to put it lightly.</p>\n<p>I do hate saying that, just because I know how exciting stuff like this is to think about. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=12\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:54:36.237Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
