        "raw": "[quote=\"MarioFanaticXV\"]\n\nHowever, there&#39;s a plethora of different super hero themed cartoons out there, the market for that is already overssaturated. This makes it far harder to pitch.\n\n[/quote]\n\nThis is a good point. The IPs saturating said market are also what Sentinels is made in homage to; there&#39;s going to be a lot of obvious overlap, especially right at the beginning.\n\nHonestly, for all that this community is large and vibrant, Sentinels is a very niche property. I think people would enjoy it, given a chance to experience its full depth, but convincing anyone whose business is money that it&#39;s worth doing is a tall order, to put it lightly.\n\nI do hate saying that, just because I know how exciting stuff like this is to think about. :/\n",
