        "raw": "[quote=\"MarioFanaticXV\"]\n\n While I&#39;ll fully admit that the list is a lot looser with the concept of &quot;superhero&quot; than I&#39;d like (Scooby-Doo and Star Wars are on the list?), if you go through the recent years manually searching for those that are still present, you&#39;ll find there&#39;s quite a number of them:  <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_superhero_television_series\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_superhero_television_series</a> And  they have seperate pages for Marvel and DC. \n\n[/quote]\n\nYeah, that&#39;s why I asked here, since I first looked through that list and found it unhelpful since almost all of the series listed that I&#39;ve heard of I wouldn&#39;t view as being superhero series. (Transformers and Mega Man? Really?)\n\nI think out of the ones currently running that I know anything of, there&#39;s maybe six? I&#39;d consider superhero stories. And two of those are reboots.\n\nInterestingly there&#39;s not as many Marvel or DC series currently ongoing as I thought either.\n",
