      {
        "id": 221833,
        "name": "bjorn.arnesen.us",
        "username": "bjorn.arnesen.us",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-05T13:51:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There might be some other problems with the obvious similarity to other super heroes. While DC and Marvel both steal from and respect each other, often having heroes who are essentially the same person, it might be a lot more difficult for similar heroes coming from card/miniatures/RP games. Although I liked that the Oblivaeon comic was short and to the point, perhaps it would be best if they started with actual comics.<br><br>I've even thought of a couple short strips, one involving a craft brewery I go to, with Fanatic asking why she can't get a growler of a beer called God's Wrath.</p>",
